@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
title Principles, patterns and refactoring
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Accepted behavior + owned invariants" as B
rectangle "Principles\nSOLID / DRY / KISS / YAGNI" as P
rectangle "Patterns\nAdapter / Strategy / Factory / Facade" as T
rectangle "Concrete design\nRoles / contracts / collaboration" as D
rectangle "Evidence / observed smells" as S
rectangle "Refactoring\nPreserve applicable behavior" as R
B --> P : constrains application
P --> D : guide choices
T --> D : optional problem-specific techniques
D --> S : inspect actual candidate
S --> R : justify bounded change
R --> D : evolve structure
B --> R : protected behavior

@enduml
